[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sqlalchemy/sqlalchemy/issues/comments/479323102","html_url":"https://github.com/sqlalchemy/sqlalchemy/issues/4585#issuecomment-479323102","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sqlalchemy/sqlalchemy/issues/4585","id":479323102,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDQ3OTMyMzEwMg==","user":{"login":"zzzeek","id":128223,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyODIyMw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/128223?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzzeek","html_url":"https://github.com/zzzeek","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzzeek/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzzeek/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzzeek/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzzeek/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzzeek/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzzeek/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzzeek/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzzeek/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzzeek/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2019-04-03T03:38:41Z","updated_at":"2019-04-03T03:38:41Z","body":"hi there -\r\n\r\nthis is not actionable without more specifics including an [MCVE](http://stackoverflow.com/help/mcve).    The issue you describe would be very noticeable.  Here's a POC, no issue:\r\n```\r\n\r\nfrom sqlalchemy import *\r\nfrom sqlalchemy.orm import *\r\nfrom sqlalchemy.ext.declarative import declarative_base\r\nfrom sqlalchemy.ext.declarative import declared_attr\r\n\r\nBase = declarative_base()\r\n\r\n\r\nclass A(Base):\r\n    __tablename__ = 'a'\r\n\r\n    id = Column(Integer, primary_key=True)\r\n    data = Column(String)\r\n\r\ne = create_engine(\"sqlite://\", echo=True)\r\nBase.metadata.create_all(e)\r\n\r\ns = Session(e)\r\n\r\ns.add(A(data='hi'))\r\ns.flush()\r\n\r\n\r\ns.commit()\r\n\r\n\r\nassert s.query(A.data).scalar() == 'hi'\r\n```","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sqlalchemy/sqlalchemy/issues/comments/479323102/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"zzzeek","id":128223,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyODIyMw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/128223?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzzeek","html_url":"https://github.com/zzzeek","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzzeek/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzzeek/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzzeek/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzzeek/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzzeek/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzzeek/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzzeek/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzzeek/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzzeek/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"id":2248567517,"node_id":"MDEyOkxhYmVsZWRFdmVudDIyNDg1Njc1MTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sqlalchemy/sqlalchemy/issues/events/2248567517","actor":{"login":"zzzeek","id":128223,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyODIyMw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/128223?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzzeek","html_url":"https://github.com/zzzeek","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzzeek/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzzeek/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzzeek/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzzeek/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/use